zip.js by Gildas Lormeau -- https://github.com/gildas-lormeau/zip.js

Vendored build: dist/zip-fs.js from @zip.js/zip.js 2.8.34 (UMD, exposes the
global `zip`). Includes ZipWriter/ZipReader, the virtual file system used by
src/R20Exporter.js, embedded web-worker code and the WASM deflate module.

Licensed BSD-3-Clause, see LICENSE.

Replaced the 2013 zip.js (zip.js + zip-ext.js + zip-fs.js + deflate.js) in
R20Exporter 0.14.0: Zip64 support, streamed writes and worker compression.
